# Frontend Rules: Mini Payment Gateway Dashboard

- Framework: Next.js (App Router), TypeScript, Tailwind CSS.
- Design: Follow design/style-guide.md for exact colors, fonts, and breakpoints. Use screenshots in design/ as visual benchmarks.
- API: Strictly follow openapi.json for all paths, request bodies, and response types. Base URL: http://127.0.0.1:8000/api.
- Auth: Manage Sanctum Bearer tokens in localStorage/cookies. Create an API client with auto-attaching headers and 401 handling.
- Icons: Use assets provided in the design folder or Lucide React.